WEBVTT

00:09:59.511 --> 00:10:01.430
but not overly personal or threatening,

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:03.599
like "What's something
that fascinates you?"

00:10:03.641 --> 00:10:06.060
Or "What's one thing
that delighted you today?"

00:10:06.769 --> 00:10:10.731
And you might be amazed by how good
just one little moment of connection

00:10:10.773 --> 00:10:12.024
can make you feel.

00:10:12.858 --> 00:10:14.860
And if you do find someone
to connect with,

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:17.571
maybe ask them to join you
in trying my third suggestion,

00:10:17.571 --> 00:10:21.533
which is to increase playfulness
by finding opportunities to rebel.

00:10:22.493 --> 00:10:25.579
Now I am not talking about
James Dean-level of rebellion.

00:10:25.579 --> 00:10:28.082
I'm talking about playful deviance.

00:10:28.082 --> 00:10:30.417
I'm talking about finding ways
to break the rules